+// pixel3-ios: a surface the GPU wrote gets a new seed at completion, as Apple's driver gives it (IOSurfaceGetSeed moves on
+// every write). CoreAnimation reads an unchanged seed as unchanged contents: the camera preview, whose buffers mediaserverd's
